{"custom_field": "প্রতি প্রশ্নের মান ১ ও ভুল উত্তরের জন্য ০.২৫ কাটা যাবে।", "question_text": {"Bank-Daily-Quiz": [{"id": "1", "question": "১) (x + y)<sup>2</sup> = ?", "option1": "x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> - 2xy", "option2": "x<sup>2</sup> - y<sup>2</sup> + 2xy", "option3": "(x + y)<sup>2</sup> - 4xy", "option4": "(x - y)<sup>2</sup> + 4xy", "answer": "4", "exp": "<strong>Question:</strong> (x + y)<sup>2</sup> = ?<br /><br /><strong>Solution:&nbsp;</strong><br />(x + y)<sup>2</sup> = x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + 2xy<br />(x + y)<sup>2</sup> = (x - y)<sup>2</sup> + 4xy"}, {"id": "2", "question": "২) If x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> = 18 and xy = 9, what is the value of (x - y)<sup>2</sup>?", "option1": "0", "option2": "4", "option3": "16", "option4": "- 6", "answer": "1", "exp": "<strong>Question:</strong> If x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> = 18 and xy = 9, what is the value of (x - y)<sup>2</sup>?<br /><br /><strong>Solution:&nbsp;</strong><br />given,<br />x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> = 18<br />xy = 9<br /><br />(x - y)<sup>2</sup> = x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> - 2xy<br />= 18 - 2 &times; 9<br />= 0"}, {"id": "3", "question": "৩) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20241016.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"415\" height=\"66\" />", "option1": "16&radic;3", "option2": "18&radic;3", "option3": "9&radic;3", "option4": "24&radic;3", "answer": "2", "exp": "<strong>Question:&nbsp;</strong><br /><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20241016.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"415\" height=\"66\" /><br /><br /><strong>Solution:&nbsp;</strong><br /><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20241016_1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"292\" height=\"308\" />"}, {"id": "4", "question": "৪) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20241016_2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"339\" height=\"62\" />", "option1": "9", "option2": "2", "option3": "- 2", "option4": "0", "answer": "4", "exp": "<strong>Question:&nbsp;</strong><br /><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20241016_2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"339\" height=\"62\" /><br /><br /><strong>Solution:&nbsp;</strong><br /><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20241016_3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"188\" height=\"311\" />"}, {"id": "5", "question": "৫) If a + b = &radic;3 and a = &radic;2 + b, what is the value of 4ab?", "option1": "0", "option2": "- 1", "option3": "1", "option4": "- 3", "answer": "3", "exp": "<strong>Question:</strong> If a + b = &radic;3 and a = &radic;2 + b, what is the value of 4ab?<br /><br /><strong>Solution:&nbsp;</strong><br />given,<br />a + b = &radic;3<br />a = &radic;2 + b<br />a - b = &radic;2<br /><br />4ab = (a + b)<sup>2</sup> - (a - b)<sup>2</sup><br />= 3 - 2<br />= 1"}, {"id": "6", "question": "৬) What should be added to 9p<sup>2</sup> + 14p so that the sum is a perfect square?", "option1": "49/7", "option2": "36/7", "option3": "49/9", "option4": "64/9", "answer": "3", "exp": "<strong>Question:</strong> What should be added to 9p<sup>2</sup> + 14p so that the sum is a perfect square?<br /><br /><strong>Solution:</strong><br />(3p)<sup>2</sup> + 2.3p.(7/3) + (7/3)<sup>2</sup><br />= (3p + 7/3)<sup>2</sup><br /><br />so, (7/3)<sup>2</sup> or, 49/9 should be added to make it a perfect square."}, {"id": "7", "question": "৭) (x + y)<sup>2</sup> + (x - y)<sup>2</sup> = ?", "option1": "x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup>", "option2": "2(x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup>)", "option3": "xy", "option4": "4xy", "answer": "2", "exp": "<strong>Question:</strong> (x + y)<sup>2</sup> + (x - y)<sup>2</sup> = ?<br /><br /><strong>Solution:</strong><br />(x + y)<sup>2</sup> + (x - y)<sup>2</sup><br />= x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + 2xy + x<sup>2</sup> - 2xy + y<sup>2</sup><br />= 2x<sup>2</sup> + 2y<sup>2</sup><br />= 2(x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup>)"}, {"id": "8", "question": "৮) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20241016_4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"352\" height=\"59\" />", "option1": "1", "option2": "1/2", "option3": "- 3/2", "option4": "- 1", "answer": "1", "exp": "<strong>Question:</strong><br /><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20241016_4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"352\" height=\"59\" /><br /><br /><strong>Solution:</strong><br /><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20241016_5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"123\" height=\"377\" />"}, {"id": "9", "question": "৯) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20241015_9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"660\" height=\"85\" />", "option1": "5/12", "option2": "25/124", "option3": "39/144", "option4": "25/144", "answer": "4", "exp": "<strong>Question</strong>: <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20241015_9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"466\" height=\"60\" /><br /><br /><strong>Solution:&nbsp;<br /><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20241015_10_Kas1T40.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"123\" height=\"358\" /><br /></strong>"}, {"id": "10", "question": "১০) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20241016_6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"483\" height=\"40\" />", "option1": "13/8", "option2": "15/8", "option3": "17/8", "option4": "18/7", "answer": "2", "exp": "<strong>Question:&nbsp;</strong><br /><img src=\"https://elasticb